    "description": "RET-SCOPE-003: \"modify their default user address\" RET-AUTH-001: \"At the beginning of the conversation, you have to authenticate the user identity by locating their user id via email, or via name + zip code. This has to be done even when the user already provides the user id.\" RET-CONFIRM-001: \"Before taking any action that updates the database (cancel, modify, return, exchange), you must list the action details and obtain explicit user confirmation (yes) to proceed.\"",
